{"id":"torrey:bread","source":"torrey","name":"Bread","slug":"bread","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Given by God — Ru 1:6; Mt 6:11.","refs":[["Ruth",1,6,1,6],["Matt",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"Yielded by the earth — Job 28:5; Isa 55:10.","refs":[["Job",28,5,28,5],["Isa",55,10,55,10]]},{"text":"Wheat. — Ex 29:2; Ps 81:16.","refs":[["Exod",29,2,29,2],["Ps",81,16,81,16]]},{"text":"Barley. — Jdj 7:13; Joh 6:9.","refs":[["Judg",7,13,7,13],["John",6,9,6,9]]},{"text":"Beans, millet, &c. — Eze 4:9.","refs":[["Ezek",4,9,4,9]]},{"text":"Manna (in the wilderness). — Nu 11:8.","refs":[["Num",11,8,11,8]]},{"text":"Corn ground for making — Isa 28:28.","refs":[["Isa",28,28,28,28]]},{"text":"Was kneaded — Ge 18:6; Jer 7:18; Ho 7:4.","refs":[["Gen",18,6,18,6],["Jer",7,18,7,18],["Hos",7,4,7,4]]},{"text":"Troughs used for kneading — Ex 12:34.","refs":[["Exod",12,34,12,34]]},{"text":"Usually leavened — Le 23:17; Mt 13:33.","refs":[["Lev",23,17,23,17],["Matt",13,33,13,33]]},{"text":"Sometimes unleavened — Ex 12:18; 1Co 5:8.","refs":[["Exod",12,18,12,18],["1Cor",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Loaves. — 1Sa 10:3,4; Mt 14:17.","refs":[["1Sam",10,3,10,3],["1Sam",10,4,10,4],["Matt",14,17,14,17]]},{"text":"Cakes. — 2Sa 6:19; 1Ki 17:13.","refs":[["2Sam",6,19,6,19],["1Kgs",17,13,17,13]]},{"text":"Wafers. — Ex 16:31; 29:23.","refs":[["Exod",16,31,16,31],["Exod",29,23,29,23]]},{"text":"On hearths. — Ge 18:6.","refs":[["Gen",18,6,18,6]]},{"text":"On coals of fire. — Isa 44:19; Joh 21:9.","refs":[["Isa",44,19,44,19],["John",21,9,21,9]]},{"text":"In ovens. — Le 26:26; Ho 7:4-7.","refs":[["Lev",26,26,26,26],["Hos",7,4,7,7]]},{"text":"Making of, a trade — Ge 40:2; Jer 37:21.","refs":[["Gen",40,2,40,2],["Jer",37,21,37,21]]},{"text":"Ordinary, called common bread — 1Sa 21:4.","refs":[["1Sam",21,4,21,4]]},{"text":"Sacred, called hallowed bread — 1Sa 21:4,6.","refs":[["1Sam",21,4,21,4],["1Sam",21,6,21,6]]},{"text":"Nutritious and strengthening — Ps 104:15.","refs":[["Ps",104,15,104,15]]},{"text":"When old, dry and mouldy — Jos 9:5,12.","refs":[["Josh",9,5,9,5],["Josh",9,12,9,12]]},{"text":"Often put for the whole substance of man — Ge 3:19; 39:6; Mt 6:11.","refs":[["Gen",3,19,3,19],["Gen",39,6,39,6],["Matt",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"The principal food used by the ancients — Ge 18:5; 21:14; 27:17; Jdj 19:5.","refs":[["Gen",18,5,18,5],["Gen",21,14,21,14],["Gen",27,17,27,17],["Judg",19,5,19,5]]},{"text":"Broken for use — La 4:4; Mt 14:19.","refs":[["Lam",4,4,4,4],["Matt",14,19,14,19]]},{"text":"Kept in baskets — Ge 40:16; Ex 29:32.","refs":[["Gen",40,16,40,16],["Exod",29,32,29,32]]},{"text":"Publicly sold — Mt 14:15; 15:33.","refs":[["Matt",14,15,14,15],["Matt",15,33,15,33]]},{"text":"In times of scarcity, sold by weight — Le 26:26; Eze 4:16.","refs":[["Lev",26,26,26,26],["Ezek",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"Scarceness of, sent as a punishment — Ps 105:16; Isa 3:1; Eze 5:16.","refs":[["Ps",105,16,105,16],["Isa",3,1,3,1],["Ezek",5,16,5,16]]},{"text":"Plenty of, promised to the obedient — Le 26:5.","refs":[["Lev",26,5,26,5]]},{"text":"Often given as a present — 1Sa 25:18; 2Sa 16:12; 1Ch 12:40.","refs":[["1Sam",25,18,25,18],["2Sam",16,12,16,12],["1Chr",12,40,12,40]]},{"text":"Served round after funerals — Eze 24:17-22.","refs":[["Ezek",24,17,24,22]]},{"text":"With water, the food of prisons — 1Ki 22:27.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,27,22,27]]},{"text":"Crumb of, used to wipe the fingers, thrown under the table — Mt 15:27; Lu 16:21.","refs":[["Matt",15,27,15,27],["Luke",16,21,16,21]]},{"text":"First fruit of, offered to God — Nu 15:19,20.","refs":[["Num",15,19,15,19],["Num",15,20,15,20]]},{"text":"Offered with sacrifices — Ex 29:2,23; Nu 28:2.","refs":[["Exod",29,2,29,2],["Exod",29,23,29,23],["Num",28,2,28,2]]},{"text":"Placed on table of shew bread — Ex 25:30.","refs":[["Exod",25,30,25,30]]},{"text":"Multitudes miraculously fed by Christ with — Mt 14:19-21; 15:34-37.","refs":[["Matt",14,19,14,21],["Matt",15,34,15,37]]},{"text":"Of Christ. — Joh 6:33-35.","refs":[["John",6,33,6,35]]},{"text":"(When broken,) of the death of Christ. — Mt 26:26; 1Co 11:23,24.","refs":[["Matt",26,26,26,26],["1Cor",11,23,11,23],["1Cor",11,24,11,24]]},{"text":"(Partaking of,) of communion of saints. — Ac 2:46; 1Co 10:17.","refs":[["Acts",2,46,2,46],["1Cor",10,17,10,17]]},{"text":"(Want of,) of extreme poverty. — Pr 12:9; Isa 3:7.","refs":[["Prov",12,9,12,9],["Isa",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"(Seeking of begging,) of extreme poverty. — 1Sa 2:36; Ps 37:25; La 1:11.","refs":[["1Sam",2,36,2,36],["Ps",37,25,37,25],["Lam",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"(Fulness of,) of abundance. — Eze 16:49.","refs":[["Ezek",16,49,16,49]]},{"text":"(Eating without scarceness,) of plenty. — De 8:9.","refs":[["Deut",8,9,8,9]]},{"text":"(Of adversity,) of heavy affliction. — Isa 30:20.","refs":[["Isa",30,20,30,20]]},{"text":"(Of tears,) of sorrow. — Ps 80:5.","refs":[["Ps",80,5,80,5]]},{"text":"(Of deceit,) of unlawful gain. — Pr 20:17.","refs":[["Prov",20,17,20,17]]},{"text":"(Of wickedness,) of oppression. — Pr 4:17.","refs":[["Prov",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"(Of idleness,) of sloth. — Pr 31:27.","refs":[["Prov",31,27,31,27]]}],"refCount":91}
